<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Cloncurry, Majestic end merger talks.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Cloncurry, Majestic end merger talks.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cloncurry Mining Co NL said on Thursday its merger talks with Majestic Resources Nl have been terminated and that both companies would pursue their own objectives independently.</p>
<p>&quot;No agreement or understanding was reached between the parties,&quot; Cloncurry said.</p>
<p>The two gold and copper explorers started merger talks on August 26 with a view to combining their interests in the Cloncurry area of northern Queensland.</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
